            0.084,
            0.744,
            0.165
          ],
          "content": "List junk foods you eat frequently. Ask your friends also to make such lists. On the basis of these lists, write a letter to your principal requesting to ban certain junk foods inside the school campus. Suggest some healthy options."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.171,
            0.744,
            0.252
          ],
          "content": " Find out the variation in nutritional requirements of different individuals based on age, physical activity and health conditions. Record your observations. Discuss and analyse."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.259,
            0.744,
            0.34
          ],
          "content": " Prepare a diet chart to provide a balanced diet to a twelve-year-old child. The diet chart should include food items that are not expensive and are commonly available in your area."
        },
        {
          "type": "aside_text",
          "bbox": [
